    {
      "id": "DanceCompetition_Text_AnnounceLeadingMon",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s it for the Dance Competition!\r",
        "Leading in points right now is\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Can anyone turn things around in the\n",
        "Acting Competition?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "L’Epreuve de Danse est terminée!\r",
        "Pour le moment, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} est\n",
        "en tête!\r",
        "Est-ce que la situation peut changer\n",
        "avec l’Epreuve de Comédie?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DanceCompetition_Text_ThanksForJoiningPracticeContest",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome! Thanks for joining our\n",
        "practice Contest!\r",
        "Feel free to practice all you want\n",
        "and train for the big show!\r",
        "I’ll be taking part to practice up\n",
        "on being an MC!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue! Merci de vous joindre à nous\n",
        "pour cette séance d’entraînement!\r",
        "Entraînez-vous autant que vous voulez\n",
        "avant le grand moment!\r",
        "Je me joins à vous pour m’entraîner\n",
        "à être Animateur!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DanceCompetition_Text_EveryoneHereForPracticeContest",
      "en_US": [
        "Looks like everyone’s here, so let’s\n",
        "get on with our dance practice!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, you need to dance just\n",
        "like the main dancer.\r",
        "After dancing twice, the main dancer\n",
        "switches with a backup dancer.\r",
        "You get to be the main dancer last.\n",
        "Do a dance that no one can imitate!\r",
        "OK! Start it up!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tout le monde est là? Bien, alors\n",
        "commençons l’entraînement Danse!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} doit imiter le premier\n",
        "danseur.\r",
        "Après avoir dansé deux fois, il change\n",
        "de place avec un autre danseur.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} sera premier danseur en\n",
        "dernier.\r",
        "Il faut faire des danses inimitables!\r",
        "OK! Allons-y!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
